                 +---------------------+
                           |
              HTTP(S) do frontend FQDN
                           |
        +------------------+------------------+
        |            App Service              |
        |  frontend  -- ip_restriction:       |
        |             Allow TYLKO snet-agw    |
        |             (service endpoint /     |
        |              subnet rule), Deny *   |
        +------------------+------------------+
                           |
                 VNet integration (snet-app)
                           |
                  [ PE backend ]  [ PE postgres ]   snet-pe

ZASOBY TF:
- azurerm_subnet "snet-agw" (bez delegacji; NSG z regułami dla
  GatewayManager 65200-65535 inbound — inaczej v2 nie wstanie)
- azurerm_public_ip (Standard, static)
- azurerm_web_application_firewall_policy (mode: Detection → potem Prevention;
  OWASP CRS 3.2, custom rules)
- azurerm_application_gateway (sku WAF_v2, firewall_policy_id, backend pool =
