   Subscription 6d204bd9-...
        |
   [ Initiative "secure-workload-baseline" ]  (azurerm_policy_set_definition)
        |-- Deny: storage accounts z shared key auth
        |-- Deny: public network access na KV / Postgres / Cognitive
        |-- Audit: brak diagnostic settings → LAW      (etap 1: WSZYSTKO Audit)
        |-- Audit: App Service bez HTTPS-only          (etap 2: flip na Deny
        |-- Deny: basic auth (FTP/SCM) na App Service   po przeglądzie compliance)
